{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14114370","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14114370","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1411437001:1":{"text":"いいかげんにしなさい！好き勝手に爆弾をしかけて――","source_cn":"你闹够了没有，到处乱跑，到处都是炸弹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x710AC409AB49E0C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1411437002:1":{"text":"地下で爆破を起こすことが、どれほど危険か分からないのですか？","source_cn":"你知道在地下这么随便爆炸有多危险吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB7CBA070AE025E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1411437003:1":{"text":"だったらナニ？カタストロフは邪悪な存在なの！","source_cn":"那又怎么样！我们恶魔就是这么邪恶！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0582899EDB149E4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1411437004:1":{"text":"全部ぶっ壊して、アタシをバカにしたことを後悔させてやるんだから！","source_cn":"我就要炸塌一切，让你们这些看不起我的人好好瞧瞧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6C26F3E721D1C26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1411437005:1":{"text":"……クルスタの本性が現れ始めましたね。どうやら、手加減は必要ないみたいだ。","source_cn":"……的确，这就是库露丝塔当年癫狂的本性，看起来我也不需...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18621759DF22D73D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1411437006:1":{"text":"もともと必要ないし！それから、そのダサい名前で呼ばないで！","source_cn":"谁用你留情！而且你提什么我以前的名字啊！土死了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x499647F0EB604A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1411437007:1":{"text":"バク、一緒にこいつらを懲らしめましょう！","source_cn":"阿爆，我们一起，给这帮家伙一点颜色看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DC6E2B844AAB28C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:巴赫朗":{"text":"バハラム","source":"巴赫朗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:库露露":{"text":"クルル","source":"库露露","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}